### Global Variables Definition
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3004
@contentType = application/json
@internalToken = secure_internal_dev_token_123

### 1. Health Diagnostics (Public Endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/web3/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. Provision Wallet (Success case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/web3/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": "user-a-12345",
  "institutionId": "inst-a-id-12345",
  "email": "user@uni-a.edu"
}

### 3. Provision Wallet Idempotency (Retry using same userId returns 200 with identical address)
POST {{baseUrl}}/web3/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": "user-a-12345",
  "institutionId": "inst-a-id-12345",
  "email": "user@uni-a.edu"
}

### 4. Fetch Wallet Info by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/web3/wallets/user-a-12345
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Fetch Wallet Info - Not Found (404 Case)
GET {{baseUrl}}/web3/wallets/non-existent-user
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6. Provision Wallet - Missing Authorization Header (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/web3/wallets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": "user-a-12345",
  "institutionId": "inst-a-id-12345",
  "email": "user@uni-a.edu"
}
